<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (The business should prioritize reactivation and retention strategies. Targeted efforts should focus on At Risk customers who previously bought frequently, alongside seasonal promotions for Hibernating users as the university semester resumes. Simultaneously, strengthening loyalty programs for Champions and Loyal Customers will secure recurring revenue and reduce heavy reliance on new customer acquisition.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
