195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (The RFM segmentation reveals that 49.2% of customers \(221 out of 449\) belong to declining or inactive groups \(Hibernating, At Risk, About to Sleep, and Need Attention\), indicating weak repeat purchasing. Conversely, Champions and Loyal Customers make up 32.3%, showing a solid core of repeat buyers. Given the business's proximity to a university campus, this high inactivity likely reflects seasonal demand drops during academic holidays.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
