/Title (The raw transaction dataset is imported and filtered for essential columns \(Date, Order ID, Customer ID, Sales\), then aggregated using Pandas to compute each customer's unique order count, latest order date, and total sales value. To operationalize recency, a reference benchmark \(today\) is established from the maximum dataset date, allowing the pipeline to calculate d_sinlas \(days since last sale\) as the baseline for behavioral analysis.)
