/Title (Customer metrics are translated into standardized scores from 1 to 5 using quintile-based binning \(pd.cut with percentile thresholds\), where Recency assigns higher scores to recent buyers, and Frequency and Monetary dimensions rank customers based on order volume and spending. This relative ranking normalizes the behavioral dimensions against the specific purchasing patterns of the laundry business.)
